+### [Bayesian Hyperparameter Optimization for Volume Rendering](19411-bayesian-hyperparameter-optimization-for-volume-rendering.md)
+This method is a multi-objective optimization process that automatically selects hyperparameters for HKTex UV-texture and multi-view image fitting, minimizing model storage size and mean squared errors across rendered views. It distinguishes itself from manual tuning by using a Tree-Structured Parzen Estimator (TPE) to navigate a search space of over 30 parameters, balancing the trade-off between reconstruction fidelity and memory footprint.
 
